WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:03.480
Aaahhhh….SCP-914 - The Clockworks.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.810
One sheet of 8.5x11in printing paper with
handwritten instructions reading: "I would

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.179
like a Quarter Pounder with Cheese.

00:00:09.179 --> 00:00:10.320
No pickles, no onions.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.969
Large order of fries, and a medium pepsi"
was placed inside on the setting 1:1.

00:00:14.969 --> 00:00:18.360
The output was the same sheet of paper, with
the text: "“I would like a Whopper.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.380
No Ketchup, No Mustard.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.990
Small order of onion rings, and a medium Coke”.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:25.210
The next sheet, with the same instructions,
was placed on the "Fine" setting.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:30.180
It produced a stack of US currency, printed
with pencil lead, equivalent to the cost of

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:31.260
the food order.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.320
The final sheet, also bearing the same instructions,
was placed on the setting Very Fine.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.899
It produced a sheet of paper inscribed with
unidentified symbols.

00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:43.260
Anyone who looked at this sheet of paper reported
a sudden craving for a cheeseburger.

